Harry successfully continued Pi Daemon generation/agent `g2bux59b2snewhqn` across the web app, the ms-dev-4 TUI, and remotely from the ms-dev-3 TUI. The runtime remained healthy across surfaces, but its available tool catalog contained only filesystem tools such as `fs_list` and `fs_read`. It could not call `caco_msg_*` and had no Bash/shell tool.

This may be an implementation gap or a Cacophony Pi Daemon profile/tool-allowlist materialization gap; determine the boundary instead of blindly enabling unrestricted execution.

