The exact bd-63fa94 single physical proof on source 78171cbe exited 70 at the initial post-boot UI health probe with safe classification app_failure_modal. The stock live-interactive-proof harness retained only system-ui-health.log for this path: its private UI XML/logcat are deleted by the EXIT trap, no screenshot is retained, and the exact disposable-bearer equality scan is reached only on the success tail after all UI actions. Consequently an early fail-closed exit cannot provide the required exact bearer scan or enough bounded evidence to distinguish the unrelated failing package, while rerunning is prohibited.

Acceptance:
