- retain bounded, owner-private, redacted safe evidence for initial non-SystemUI app-failure-modal classification (safe package/class enum or hash, UI XML/screenshot/hash, bounded safe logcat as policy permits);
- preserve Pi Droid-fatal and SystemUI precedence and never dismiss arbitrary app modals;
